    "body": "`exrule` and `rrule` are indirectly affected.\n\nHTML:\n\n> The value must be text that matches the RECUR value type defined in the iCalendar specification. [RFC2445]\n\nRFC 5545:\n\n> A.3.  Deprecated Features\n> [...]\n> \n> (4)  The value type RECUR no longer allows multiple values to be specified by a COMMA-separated list of values.\n",
