    "created_at": "2016-01-18T09:15:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-18T09:15:22Z",
    "body": "Is there much point in supporting features which calendaring software tends to not actually support?\nE.g. http://www.ietf.org/mail-archive/web/calsify/current/msg00070.html and http://www.ietf.org/mail-archive/web/calsify/current/msg00868.html say that EXRULE had interoperability problems and wasn't widely implemented.\n",
